<title>BELGIUM: TENNIS-WIMBLEDON FIRST ROUND DRAW FOR BELGIANS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WIMBLEDON FIRST ROUND DRAW FOR BELGIANS.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round draws for the Wimbledon tennis championships (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Men's singles Sargis Sargsian (Armenia) v Johan Van Herck (Belgium) Andrei Pavel (Romania) v Filip Dewulf (Belgium)</p>
<p>Women's singles Sabine Appelmans (Belgium) v Rene Simpson (Canada) Nathalie Dechy (France) v Laurence Courtois (Belgium) Joanetta Kruger (South Africa) v Stephanie Deville (Belgium) Els Callens (Belgium) v Paola Suarez (Argentina) Dominique Monami-Van Roost (Belgium) v 9-Mary Pierce (France)</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6815, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
